sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Receptionist as Receptionist / Patient
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Receptionist->>System: submitRegistrationDetails(name, dob, gender, phone, email, address)
    activate System
    System->>System: validateFields()
    System->>System: checkDuplicatePatient(phone)
    System->>System: generateUHID()
    System-->>Receptionist: registrationSuccess(patientId, UHIDCard)
    deactivate System
